#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Web: the bank-transfer receipt only appears once the bank confirms.

After "Send", customers see "Confirming your transfer..." (usually a few seconds),
then the receipt. If the bank takes over a minute: "Your transfer is on its way"
with how to follow it. If it fails: the reason, and the money is back in the wallet.
Needs the backend update oam-withdrawal-receipt-status-backend.
Fine whether or not you installed the earlier receipt update.

Unzip in the web project root (with package.json), then:
    python3 apply_withdrawal_receipt_status_web.py
    npm run build
"""
